WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:17.320
I searched the distance
I watched the sky

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:22.540
I waited for You
To pass me by

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:27.100
But in the silence
I finally knew

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.120
The breath in my lungs
Was delivered by You

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:37.660
Not far away
Not somewhere above

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:44.600
You have been here
You have been enough

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:50.920
Closer than the air around me
Nearer than my heartbeat

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:54.540
You are here
You are here

00:00:54.540 --> 00:01:00.720
Breathe life into the silence
Wake what sleeps inside me

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:10.300
By Your Holy Spirit
Break chains; set me free.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:34.680
Where hope grew quiet
Where faith grew thin

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:39.960
You never left me
You stayed within

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:45.080
No empty distance
No endless sea

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:50.600
Could ever carry
Your love from me

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:55.600
Before I called
You knew my name

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:59.440
Before I reach
Your hand remains

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:08.360
Closer than the air around me
Nearer than my heartbeat

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:12.340
You are here
You are here

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:18.340
Breathe life into the silence
Wake what sleeps inside me

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:28.040
By Your Holy Spirit
Break chains; set me free.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:39.020
You are not far
You are not gone

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:46.380
You are here
In every breath

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:52.380
In every dawn

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:56.980
You are here
Breathe again

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:02.240
Breathe again
What was dry

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:07.500
Let it live
What was still

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:13.420
Let it rise

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:22.760
By Your Spirit
Breathe again

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:29.380
Breathe again

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:36.020
Closer than the air around me
Nearer than my heartbeat

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:39.740
You are here
You are here

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:45.960
Breathe life into the silence
Wake what sleeps inside me

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:55.940
By Your Holy Spirit
Break chains; set me free.

00:03:56.020 --> 00:04:01.820
In You I live
In You I move

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:10.080
Every breath
Belongs to You

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:25.920
To You ...
